# Quiz Maker & Study Assistant

A Java application that allows students to create quizzes, take quizzes, and review their results.

## Week 1 (v0.1)
- Created eight Java classes.
  1. Main
  2. Question
  3. Quiz
  4. QuizResult
  5. User
  6. Course
  7. School
  8. Folder
- Implemented basic quiz creation.
- Tested the application in IntelliJ IDEA.

## Week 2 (v0.2)
- Added
  1. JavaFX UI
  2. Start of Student and Teacher profiles
  3. Saved results and review
  4. Teacher control over feedback
- Implemented grading and quiz taking
- Tested the application in IntelliJ IDEA.
